  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Puzzles Lib</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 是一个库模组，被许多 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">@heyitsfuzs</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 的 Minecraft 模组所依赖。它本身不添加新的方块、物品、生物或游戏玩法，而是为这些模组提供正常运行所需的共享系统。🧩</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">对于玩家而言，这意味着更简单的安装和更一致的行为表现。如果另一个模组将此模组列为必需，请将其与该模组一起安装并保持启用即可。✅</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">此模组主要针对 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">@heyitsfuzs</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 自己的项目构建，并非旨在成为其他模组开发者的通用库。其重点是保持这些模组的可靠性、可维护性，并在支持的模组加载器上均可运行。🔧</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">必需库：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">为许多 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">@heyitsfuzs</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模组提供所需的共享基础。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多加载器支持：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">帮助支持的模组在 Fabric 和 NeoForge 上保持一致运行。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">共享模组系统：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">支持依赖模组使用的公共功能，例如配置、网络、事件和注册支持。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🚀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">轻量级基础：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在后台运行，不添加游戏内容或占用世界资源。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">提高整合包可靠性：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">减少模组间的重复系统，帮助依赖模组表现更一致。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌐 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端和服务端支持：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">专为单人游戏、多人游戏和专用服务器环境设计。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端和服务端均需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Fabric API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 端）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config API Port</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 端）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bag-of-holding\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tiny-skeletons\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/pick-up-notifier\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
